+/* VS_SPI_STATS.REQ (0xA11C)
+Fields:
+- Command (1 byte): 0x00 = Get statistics, 0x01 = Reset statistics
+*/
+
+/* VS_SPI_STATS.CNF (0xA11D)
+- Result (1 byte): 0x00 = Success, 0x01 = Failure
+- Rx packets (4 bytes): Number of packets received
+- Rx unicast (4 bytes): Number of unicast packets received
+- Rx CMD_RTS (4 bytes): Number of CMD_RTS correctly received
+- Rx CMD_RTS error (4 bytes): Number of CMD_RTS received with wrong delimiter or
+wrong command type
+- Rx CMD_RTS wrong length (4 bytes): Number of CMD_RTS received with wrong data
+length
+- Rx data error (4 bytes): Number of data packets received without SOF delimiter
+- Rx abort due to queue full: Number of RX action aborted due to SPI RX queue
+full
+- Rx wait re-assembled fragment length (2 bytes): Total length of received
+fragments which are waiting to be re-assembled
+- Tx packets (4 bytes): Number of packets transmitted
+- Tx unicast (4 bytes): Number of unicast packets transmitted
+- Tx CMD_RTS (4 bytes): Number of CMD_RTS transmitted
+- Tx CMD_CTR (4 bytes): Number of CMD_CTR transmitted
+- Tx CMD_RTS timeout abort (4 bytes): Number of CMD_RTS timeout abort
+- Tx CMD_CTR timeout abort (4 bytes): Number of CMD_CTR timeout abort
+- Tx packets drop due to queue full (4 bytes): Number of packets from PLC
+dropped due to SPI TX queue full
+- Fragment expire happen (4 bytes): Number of timeout-to-received fragment data
+- Rx CMD_CTR (4 bytes): Number of CMD_CTR commands received
+- Rx command error (4 bytes): Number of received commands not started with
+DET_CMD
+- Rx command fail (4 bytes): Number of fail-to-received commands
+- Rx unknown command (4 bytes): Number of received unknown commands
+- Rx data DFT error (4 bytes): Number of received data packets whose DFT is
+invalid
+- Tx CMD_RTS fail (4 bytes): Number of failed transmissions of CMD_RTS command
+- Tx CMD_CTR fail (4 bytes): Number of failed transmissions of CMD_CTR command
+- Tx data error (4 bytes): Number of failed transmissions of data packets
+*/
